<title>EGYPT: Arafat in Cairo to brief Mubarak.</title>
<headline>Arafat in Cairo to brief Mubarak.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat briefed Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak on Friday on his trip to Europe and the latest developments in Israeli-Palestinian negotiations, official sources said.</p>
<p>Arafat, a frequent visitor to Egypt, arrived in Cairo early on Friday and will leave later for Gaza, where he is expected to meet Russian Foreign Minister Yevgeny Primakov, they said.</p>
</text>
